msgstr "The masters of the forge have begun their work."

#: simulation/narration.py:68
msgid "Nos hommes sont partis piller les villages."
msgstr "Our people have departed to plunder the villages."

#: simulation/narration.py:69
msgid "Nos hommes sont partis conquérir la cité."
msgstr "Our people have departed to capture the city."

