msgstr "Our lookouts sent this news. Their intelligence remains limited to what they could observe."

msgid "L’ouvrage demeure endommagé, Monseigneur. Une réparation rétablirait son service."
msgstr "The structure remains damaged, my lord. Repairs would restore its service."

